# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# Development is on Windows and CI runs on Linux. Without this a file committed with
# CRLF differs byte-for-byte from the same file written on Linux — which matters most
# for SQL migrations, whose checksums are how the runner detects an edited file.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
